# Frontend & API conventions

## Stack (binding when code exists)

- TypeScript, functional React + hooks, Tailwind (no inline style except dynamic grid coords).
- SWR for server state; Redux Toolkit for UI (tab, kiosk, filters, perf-mode).
- react-hook-form + zod for admin forms; i18next default `vi`.
- Absolute imports `@/` → `src`. Feature-based folders.
- Charts: ECharts (canvas). Map: MapLibre. Org: React Flow.

## Naming

| Kind | Rule |
|------|------|
| Components | PascalCase |
| Hooks | `use` + camelCase |
| Constants | `UPPER_SNAKE_CASE` |
| Types/interfaces | prefix `I`, PascalCase |
| Services | PascalCase + `Service` |
| Utils | camelCase |

JSDoc on exported functions, hooks, components. No `any` / `any[]` / `unknown` unless unavoidable.

## Product contracts in code

- Frontend **does not compute KPI**. BFF returns shaped tab payloads.
- Widget must handle loading / empty / error / stale (cache + timestamp, never blank TV).
- TV: font token ≥ `caption` 18px; max 9 widgets/tab; Top N = 5; no page scroll at 1920×1080.
- Numbers: VN grouping (`24.860,5 tỷ`); delta color = **direction tốt**, not “tăng = xanh”.
- Cleanup: `echarts.dispose()`, timer/SSE unsubscribe, no unbounded listeners (kiosk 24/7).
